# Example key names for AI-Verse OS. This file has no values and is safe to share.
# Your real keys live in `.env` (same folder), which is never committed.
# Save one without showing it:  node scripts/secrets.mjs set NAME
# See what is set:              node scripts/secrets.mjs status
# Use them in one command:      node scripts/secrets.mjs run -- <command>
#
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
# REPLICATE_API_TOKEN=
